BUGS FOUND AND FIXED DURING VERIFICATION (both real, caught by the sim)
  B1. execDriveG ranged the SIGNED value -> G-0.2 rejected. Fix: range the
      magnitude, sign carries direction (mirrors stage-3 F/B abs handling).
  B2. first draft was variant A (next letter fetched only after the motion):
      the parser consumed "L90"/"G0.3" chars mid-drive and the stage-3/4
      "new command aborts running motion" rule ate them -> sequences corrupted.
      Fix: execution variant B (guide stage-6 table) - non-blocking parser as
      chars arrive, complete commands wait in an 8-entry program queue,
      dispatchStep starts the next when idle. queue full = err + honest drop.

