DESICIONS RECORDED FOR REPORT_STAGE5 (sec.2)
  - G: signed metres (negative = backwards) per the guide's table; mm conversion
    at the exec layer, odometry stays mm
  - L/R: direction from the letter; negative argument = abs (one convention
    across stages 3/4/5)
  - ranges: G 0.005..5.000 m (stage 3 envelope), L/R 5..1440 deg (stage 4)
  - out-of-range: one err line, no motion, rest of string continues
  - case-insensitive letters; unknown chars skipped silently; diag keys
    (c b e m p s t x z h K J) are reserved single chars (documented trade-off)
  - execution variant B with QUEUE_CAP=8 (64 B RAM); c/b abort = stop + flush
